  "conditions": "Our 60th season celebrating skiing in the Tetons crosses the finish line today. Spring ski conditions will flourish as 1\" of new snow touched up some of the high-country blemishes. Look for AM sunshine to move into early afternoon precipitation as temperatures range from the high 20's at the summit to the mid-50's at our base. Moderate winds will be trending out of the SSW at 10-20 MPH with late afternoon thunderstorms possible. Another chapter has been written, but the final word has not been said, so come out and finish your story for the 2025-2026 ski season in good fashion as this year has been one for the memory banks. Ski safe, finish strong, and we will see you all next November to see what the 61st chapter brings! Cheers!! -MB",
